Package: fmrilss
Type: Package
Title: Least Squares Separate (LSS) Analysis for fMRI Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Brad",
                  family = "Buchsbaum",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com")
Description: Implements efficient least squares separate (LSS) analysis for
    functional magnetic resonance imaging (fMRI) data, following Mumford et al.
    (2012) <doi:10.1016/j.neuroimage.2011.08.076>. LSS estimates trial-by-trial
    activation patterns in event-related designs. The package provides reference
    R implementations, optimized C++ backends, prewhitening, and methods for
    voxel-specific haemodynamic response functions.
